Comment: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:43.95,kanji - C,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k15}{\k78}新{\k31}しい{\k30}ジェ{\k17}ネ{\k33}レー{\k44}ション{\k25}
Comment: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:16.06,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The Chaos World’s right by your side
Comment: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:18.24,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I-I don’t wanna miss you
Comment: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:23.08,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I want you to pick up on all my secret signs; it’s a whole new Generation
Comment: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:32.60,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I don’t know anything about “it,” I’m innocent and sweet as honey
Comment: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:33.26,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}(Honey)
Comment: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:38.12,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}And since you don’t wanna teach me, I just wanna know all the more!
Comment: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:38.25,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}(kyun)
Comment: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:43.13,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}So much pleasure and mankind’s next evolution...
Comment: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:44.42,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Wanna stop?
Comment: 0,0:00:44.39,0:00:45.64,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}(Don’t you dare stop!)
Comment: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:46.91,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Almost there?
Comment: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:48.48,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}(Keep going...!) Haha!
Comment: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:53.26,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}We’re not children, we have the right to know!
Comment: 0,0:00:52.73,0:00:53.62,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}(So...)
Comment: 0,0:00:53.26,0:00:55.76,translation - A,A,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}“Where do babies come from?”
Comment: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:58.30,translation - A,A,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}“Do the storks come and deliver them?”
Comment: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:00.86,translation - A,A,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Duwa Papa; Duwa Papa; Duwa Papa; Duwa Papa
Comment: 0,0:01:00.86,0:01:03.80,translation - C,C,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Duwa Mama; Duwa Mama; Duwa Mama; Duwa Mama
Comment: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:05.69,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu Chu Love; Chu Chu Love
Comment: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:09.85,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Chu Chu Love; Chu Chu Love; Chu Chu Love; Chu Chu Love; Chu Chu Love
Comment: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:15.49,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Let’s pretend like we’re adults for that moment of release!
Comment: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:20.42,translation - B,B,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I’m never letting you go, I’m a bad, bad, bad girl!
Comment: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:25.59,translation - C,C,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Let’s embrace each other passionately in our barest form
Comment: 0,0:01:25.59,0:01:33.76,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Right now my heart’s screaming, “I’m ready, go!” so plug it right in
Comment: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:36.88,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The Chaos World’s right by your side,
Comment: 0,0:01:36.68,0:01:39.09,translation - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I-I don’t wanna miss you
Comment: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:43.95,translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I want you to pick up on all my secret signs; it’s a whole new Generation
